# The seeded world is 17MB and reproducible in under a second:
#
#     cargo run --release -p solstice-bench --bin s2-fixture
#
# The small files beside it are committed, because they are the cross-check: a
# host that builds a different query IR than `query-1000.bin` is measuring a
# different query.
s2.db
s2.db-wal
s2.db-shm
